</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A4_zvhzfbmD3Sc7" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
of June 30, 2026, <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeNumberOfOutstandingOptions_iI_pid_c20260630_zsJauSB2fk5i" title="Options outstanding, outstanding number of options, shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeNumberOfOutstandingOptions" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30" id="Fact000831" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">50,000</ix:nonFraction></span> stock options were outstanding, resulting in <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--IncrementalCommonSharesAttributableToShareBasedPaymentArrangements_c20250701__20260630_zqWDyK31HzC3" title="Stock options, incremental shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:IncrementalCommonSharesAttributableToShareBasedPaymentArrangements" contextRef="From2025-07-01to2026-06-30" id="Fact000833" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">13,909</ix:nonFraction></span> incremental shares included in the calculation of diluted
earnings per share under the treasury stock method.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
of June 30, 2025, <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeNumberOfOutstandingOptions_iI_pid_c20250630_zkyeBVpDarB8" title="Options outstanding, outstanding number of options, shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeNumberOfOutstandingOptions" contextRef="AsOf2025-06-30" id="Fact000835" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">50,000</ix:nonFraction></span> options were outstanding. These options were not included in the computation of diluted earnings per share because
their exercise price exceeded the average market price of the Company&#8217;s common stock during the period and, therefore, their effect
would have been anti-dilutive.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


