</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AF_zdfdlNiprwxb" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">For
the years ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, depreciation expense totaled $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--Depreciation_c20250701__20260630_zqhNGT3oGdx8" title="Depreciation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2025-07-01to2026-06-30" id="Fact001007" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">1,238,421</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--Depreciation_c20240701__20250630_zjJ1cEvmfQ43" title="Depreciation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2024-07-012025-06-30" id="Fact001009" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">1,463,783</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively. Of these amounts, $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--CostOfGoodsAndServicesSoldDepreciation_c20250701__20260630_zBqbGk09DBpl" title="Depreciation reflected in cost of revenues"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CostOfGoodsAndServicesSoldDepreciation" contextRef="From2025-07-01to2026-06-30" id="Fact001011" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">783,692</ix:nonFraction></span>
and $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--CostOfGoodsAndServicesSoldDepreciation_c20240701__20250630_zJ8a1ZB2OCZ5" title="Depreciation reflected in cost of revenues"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CostOfGoodsAndServicesSoldDepreciation" contextRef="From2024-07-012025-06-30" id="Fact001013" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">952,331</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively, are reflected in cost of revenues.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

