<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">During
the year ended June 30, 2026, the Company capitalized $<span id="xdx_90B_ecustom--CapitalizedDevelopmentCosts_c20250701__20260630_zENJII2j9DM1" title="Capitalized development cost"><ix:nonFraction name="NTWK:CapitalizedDevelopmentCosts" contextRef="From2025-07-01to2026-06-30" id="Fact001166" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">2,686,392</ix:nonFraction></span> of costs related to internal-use software projects. As of June 30, 2026,
these projects had not been placed into service and, accordingly, no amortization expense was recognized during the year.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

