<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Notes
to Consolidated Financial Statements</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>June
30, 2026 and 2025</b></span></p>


<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 6pt; width: 100%"><tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<td style="width: 15pt; text-align: right"><span id="xdx_F07_zWg3zrLoUOti" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(2)</span></td><td style="width: 5pt"/><td style="text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F1A_znCdeWa7ZvX7" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001359" xml:lang="en-US">The Company has
an uncommitted discretionary demand line of credit up to an aggregate amount of $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity_iI_uUSD_c20260630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--HSBCBankMember_zAsiJPTMj2Q2" title="Line of credit facility, maximum borrowing capacity" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30_custom_HSBCBankMember" id="Fact001361" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span> with HSBC, secured by a lien on the Company&#8217;s
assets. The annual interest rate was <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_c20260630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--HSBCBankMember_zJCc45acNuFc" title="Interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30_custom_HSBCBankMember" id="Fact001363" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">8.0</ix:nonFraction></span>% and <span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_c20250630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--HSBCBankMember_zAw63aAzMPI" title="Interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2025-06-30_custom_HSBCBankMember" id="Fact001365" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">7.75</ix:nonFraction></span>% as of June 30, 2026 and 2025, respectively. The total outstanding balance as of June
30, 2026 and 2025, was $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--LineOfCredit_iI_dxL_uUSD_c20260630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--HSBCBankMember_zlpLby8zlrEf" title="Line of credit::XDX::-" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden: xdx2ixbrl1367">nil</span></span> and $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--LineOfCredit_iI_uUSD_c20250630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--HSBCBankMember_zLmFEWyMiFri" title="Line of credit" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LineOfCredit" contextRef="AsOf2025-06-30_custom_HSBCBankMember" id="Fact001369" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">405,000</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively.</ix:footnote></span></td>
</tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 6pt; width: 100%"><tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<td style="width: 15pt; text-align: right"><span id="xdx_F0A_zcezfpMwnFf1" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(3)</span></td><td style="width: 5pt"/><td style="text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F19_z1rWC0MnePEk" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001370" xml:lang="en-US">The Company&#8217;s
subsidiary, NTE, has an overdraft facility with HSBC Bank plc whereby the bank would cover any overdrafts up to &#163;<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity_iI_uGBP_c20260630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--HSBCBankMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--NTEMember_zvb4HFHLcRC1" title="Line of credit facility, maximum borrowing capacity" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30_custom_HSBCBankMember_custom_NTEMember" id="Fact001372" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="GBP">300,000</ix:nonFraction></span>, or approximately
$<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity_iI_c20260630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--HSBCBankMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--NTEMember_zRgoOskThqa4" title="Line of credit facility, maximum borrowing capacity" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30_custom_HSBCBankMember_custom_NTEMember" id="Fact001374" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">394,737</ix:nonFraction></span>. The annual interest rate was <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20260630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--HSBCBankMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--NTEMember_zRkTnsyCakGd" title="Debt instrument, interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30_custom_HSBCBankMember_custom_NTEMember" id="Fact001376" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">8.0</ix:nonFraction></span>% and <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20250630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--HSBCBankMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--NTEMember_zjLKhzVzNuod" title="Debt instrument, interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2025-06-30_custom_HSBCBankMember_custom_NTEMember" id="Fact001378" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">8.5</ix:nonFraction></span>% as of June 30, 2026 and 2025, respectively. The total outstanding balance as of
June 30, 2026 and 2025 was &#163;<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--LineOfCredit_iI_dxL_uGBP_c20260630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--HSBCBankMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--NTEMember_z79mCkbfnm7f" title="Line of credit::XDX::-" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--LineOfCredit_iI_dxL_uGBP_c20250630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--HSBCBankMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--NTEMember_zrB2YSxAGzk4" title="Line of credit::XDX::-" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden: xdx2ixbrl1380"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden: xdx2ixbrl1382">nil</span></span></span></span>.</ix:footnote></span></td>
</tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 6pt; width: 100%"><tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<td style="width: 15pt; text-align: right"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></td><td style="width: 5pt"/><td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">This overdraft facility
                                                                                                                                                             requires that the aggregate amount of invoiced trade debtors (net of provisions for bad and doubtful debts and excluding intra-group
                                                                                                                                                             debtors) of NTE, not exceeding 90 days old, will not be less than an amount equal to <span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityUnusedCapacityCommitmentFeePercentage_pid_dp_c20250701__20260630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--HSBCBankMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--NTEMember_z74Rzx25Kt9j" title="Commitment fee percentage" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityUnusedCapacityCommitmentFeePercentage" contextRef="From2025-07-012026-06-30_custom_HSBCBankMember_custom_NTEMember" id="Fact001384" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">200</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the facility. As of June 30, 2026, NTE
                                                                                                                                                             was in compliance with this covenant.</span></td>
</tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 6pt; width: 100%"><tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<td style="width: 15pt; text-align: right"><span id="xdx_F03_zEXRWxLoLtV1" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(4)</span></td><td style="width: 5pt"/><td style="text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F11_zPsFugAmJmZi" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001385" xml:lang="en-US">The Company&#8217;s
subsidiary, NetSol PK, has an export refinance facility with Askari Bank Limited, secured by NetSol PK&#8217;s assets. This is a revolving
loan that matures every six months. The total facility amount is Rs. <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity_iI_pp0p0_uPKR_c20260630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--AskariBankLimitedMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--NetSolPKMember__us-gaap--CreditFacilityAxis__custom--RefinanceFacilityMember_z1SsB11E8357" title="Line of credit facility, maximum borrowing capacity" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30_custom_AskariBankLimitedMember_custom_NetSolPKMember_custom_RefinanceFacilityMember" id="Fact001387" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="PKR">600,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span> or $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity_iI_pp0p0_uUSD_c20260630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--AskariBankLimitedMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--NetSolPKMember__us-gaap--CreditFacilityAxis__custom--RefinanceFacilityMember_z0cJEVP7FW45" title="Line of credit facility, maximum borrowing capacity" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30_custom_AskariBankLimitedMember_custom_NetSolPKMember_custom_RefinanceFacilityMember" id="Fact001389" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">2,157,963</ix:nonFraction></span> and Rs. <span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity_iI_pp0p0_uPKR_c20250630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--AskariBankLimitedMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--NetSolPKMember__us-gaap--CreditFacilityAxis__custom--RefinanceFacilityMember_zuRFLEz5Qni3" title="Line of credit facility, maximum borrowing capacity" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" contextRef="AsOf2025-06-30_custom_AskariBankLimitedMember_custom_NetSolPKMember_custom_RefinanceFacilityMember" id="Fact001391" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="PKR">600,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span> or $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity_iI_pp0p0_uUSD_c20250630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--AskariBankLimitedMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--NetSolPKMember__us-gaap--CreditFacilityAxis__custom--RefinanceFacilityMember_zGUUU5n8Xub1" title="Line of credit facility, maximum borrowing capacity" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" contextRef="AsOf2025-06-30_custom_AskariBankLimitedMember_custom_NetSolPKMember_custom_RefinanceFacilityMember" id="Fact001393" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">2,111,561</ix:nonFraction></span> at June
30, 2026 and 2025, respectively. NetSol PK used Rs. <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity_iI_pp0p0_uPKR_c20260630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--AskariBankLimitedMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--NetSolPKMember_zMCjAnktMrr6" title="Line of credit facility, maximum borrowing capacity" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30_custom_AskariBankLimitedMember_custom_NetSolPKMember" id="Fact001395" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="PKR">500,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span> or $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity_iI_pp0p0_uUSD_c20260630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--AskariBankLimitedMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--NetSolPKMember_zBn5yrpP7r82" title="Line of credit facility, maximum borrowing capacity" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30_custom_AskariBankLimitedMember_custom_NetSolPKMember" id="Fact001397" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">1,798,302</ix:nonFraction></span> at June 30, 2026 and Rs. <span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity_iI_pp0p0_uPKR_c20250630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--AskariBankLimitedMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--NetSolPKMember_zPrcJ3zpQh48" title="Line of credit facility, maximum borrowing capacity" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" contextRef="AsOf2025-06-30_custom_AskariBankLimitedMember_custom_NetSolPKMember" id="Fact001399" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="PKR">500,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span> or $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity_iI_pp0p0_uUSD_c20250630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--AskariBankLimitedMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--NetSolPKMember_zzjtkUgFo0vg" title="Line of credit facility, maximum borrowing capacity" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" contextRef="AsOf2025-06-30_custom_AskariBankLimitedMember_custom_NetSolPKMember" id="Fact001401" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">1,759,634</ix:nonFraction></span> at June
30, 2025. The interest rate for the loan was <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20260630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--AskariBankLimitedMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--NetSolPKMember_zA7PV0j9oSce" title="Debt instrument, interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30_custom_AskariBankLimitedMember_custom_NetSolPKMember" id="Fact001403" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.5</ix:nonFraction></span>% and <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20250630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--AskariBankLimitedMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--NetSolPKMember_zjIlfjj5g8Rd" title="Debt instrument, interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2025-06-30_custom_AskariBankLimitedMember_custom_NetSolPKMember" id="Fact001405" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">8.0</ix:nonFraction></span>% at June 30, 2026 and 2025, respectively.</ix:footnote></span></td>
</tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 6pt; width: 100%"><tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<td style="width: 15pt; text-align: right"><span id="xdx_F03_zZ82UqhRJp3d" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(5)</span></td><td style="width: 5pt"/><td style="text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F11_zPrxdLB7Kh4" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001406" xml:lang="en-US">The Company&#8217;s
subsidiary, NetSol PK, has a running finance facility with Askari Bank Limited, secured by NetSol PK&#8217;s assets. The total facility
amount is Rs. <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity_iI_pp0p0_uPKR_c20260630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--AskariBankLimitedMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--NetSolPKMember__us-gaap--CreditFacilityAxis__custom--RunningFinanceFacilityMember_zbzubiD23V63" title="Line of credit facility, maximum borrowing capacity" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30_custom_AskariBankLimitedMember_custom_NetSolPKMember_custom_RunningFinanceFacilityMember" id="Fact001408" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="PKR">4,050,937</ix:nonFraction></span> or $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity_iI_pp0p0_uUSD_c20260630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--AskariBankLimitedMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--NetSolPKMember__us-gaap--CreditFacilityAxis__custom--RunningFinanceFacilityMember_zDVNSETxvJyg" title="Line of credit facility, maximum borrowing capacity" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30_custom_AskariBankLimitedMember_custom_NetSolPKMember_custom_RunningFinanceFacilityMember" id="Fact001410" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">14,570</ix:nonFraction></span> and Rs. <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity_iI_pp0p0_uPKR_c20250630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--AskariBankLimitedMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--NetSolPKMember__us-gaap--CreditFacilityAxis__custom--RunningFinanceFacilityMember_zE0MoWziAlll" title="Line of credit facility, maximum borrowing capacity" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" contextRef="AsOf2025-06-30_custom_AskariBankLimitedMember_custom_NetSolPKMember_custom_RunningFinanceFacilityMember" id="Fact001412" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="PKR">4,050,937</ix:nonFraction></span> or $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity_iI_pp0p0_uUSD_c20250630__us-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityAxis__custom--AskariBankLimitedMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--NetSolPKMember__us-gaap--CreditFacilityAxis__custom--RunningFinanceFacilityMember_zpNbynqwiPN6" title="Line of credit facility, maximum borrowing capacity" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIENPTVBPTkVOVFMgT0YgTk9URVMgUEFZQUJMRSBBTkQgQ0FQSVRBTCBMRUFTRVMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" contextRef="AsOf2025-06-30_custom_AskariBankLimitedMember_custom_NetSolPKMember_custom_RunningFinanceFacilityMember" id="Fact001414" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">14,256</ix:nonFraction></span>, at June 30, 2026 and 2025, respectively. The balance outstanding at
