                                                                                                                                                             NetSol PK to maintain a long-term debt equity ratio of 60:40 and the current ratio of 1:1. As of June 30, 2026, NetSol PK was in
                                                                                                                                                             compliance with this covenant</ix:nonNumeric></span>.</span></td>
</tr></table>

