<td style="width: 15pt; text-align: right"><span id="xdx_F06_z1PDdSiutUn4" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(11)</span></td><td style="width: 5pt"/><td style="text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F12_zN67CuBa1Vak" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001508" xml:lang="en-US">The Company leases
various fixed assets under capital lease arrangements expiring in various years through 2029. The assets and liabilities under capital
leases are recorded at the lower of the present value of the minimum lease payments or the fair value of the asset. The assets are secured
by the assets themselves. Depreciation of assets under capital leases is included in depreciation expense for the years ended June 30,
2026 and 2025.</ix:footnote></span></td>
</tr></table>

