<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-07-01to2026-06-30" escape="true" id="Fact001676" name="NTWK:ScheduleOfIncomeTaxesPaidNetOfRefundsReceivedTableTextBlock"><p id="xdx_89A_ecustom--ScheduleOfIncomeTaxesPaidNetOfRefundsReceivedTableTextBlock_zGmQukmflOKh" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
following table presents income taxes paid, net of refunds received, disaggregated by federal, state and local, and foreign jurisdictions
for the year ended June 30, 2026.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></p>

